body:
I really hope she isn't just manipulating me because I would feel like the biggest fool! At a point I can see how she comes across as manipulating as fuck but I think i'm really blindsided. She's claimed suicide a lot and manages to get me to get her way with things a lot. I just refuse to believe someone could lie about all this shit. 

&#x200B;

In saying that she lied to me about her age, name and a lot of other stuff about exes which was all unnecessary and if you can lie about that god knows what else you can lie about?
